Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:08:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] eSimSwitcher: Preserve slot mapping across SIM type changes

Save the slot mapping before UIM power-down and restore it after
switching to keep the eSIM port active.

Only switch SIM types when supported by the slot.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: Ibfcf4dc78c420b08b9e09aa8c25cc70bb0f973c4
